itor out of my room!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Door_Open","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Wait!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Two burly men dressed all in black appear quietly from behind and seize you by the arms politely."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-180","spriteScale":"1.3"}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_stage12","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Kalina?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I just looked you up quickly. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You're the temporary manager of Franchouchou, the opening act tonight, aren't you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-180","spriteScale":"1.3"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kalina?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You'd better worry about your group. They're not doing very well on stage."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Howling","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Kalina shows you the live monitor—Franchouchou is currently dancing stiffly on the stage."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Crowd","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You can see the suffering and despair on their faces as the audience's angry boos almost drown out their singing."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],